  %% ── Dependency DAG (allowed direction only) ──
  SDK --> DEEP
  SDK --> NANO
  DEEP --> NANO
  SDK --> SOOTHE
  NANO --> SOOTHE
  SDK --> DAEMON
  SOOTHE --> DAEMON
  SDK --> CLI
  CLIENT --> CLI

  %% ── Hard import bans (dashed red) ──
  SOOTHE -. "must NOT import" .-> CLI
